@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 # POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/periods/rollover — roll a fiscal year (yyyy, FY<yyyy>) over: generate the next fiscal
 # year's twelve periods exactly as generate-fy does, then add each person's open figure at the end of the old year's
 # last period (the due of their claims that count, belonging to a period of the old year, OPEN or PENDING at that
-# period's end) to their carried figure for the new year's first period, written as OPENING_SET; then ROLLOVER. A year
+# period's end) to their carried figure for the new year's first period (only when this rollover generated it),
+# written as OPENING_SET; then keep the rollover so it can be undone (see rollover-undo), and ROLLOVER. A year
 # that is not yyyy, a fiscal year with no periods, or anyone but a steward is a 400 and writes nothing. Responds with
 # how many periods were made.
 validate:
